        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-SQPULL36-622, 3 Foot Modern Matte Black Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Matte Black 36 Inch Square Ladder Pull has a rich finish that is a true black. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It has a 24-1/2 inch center to center and the pull itself is 1-3/16 inches square, for a comfortable grip and a sturdy feel even on the heaviest of doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SQPULL36-specifcations.gif?v=1704354558\" width=\"485\" height=\"165\" boarder=\"0\" alt=\"DWDSQULL36-622 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in <a href=\"/products/3-foot-oil-rubbed-bronze-square-door-pull-dwd-sqpull36-613\"><b>Oil Rubbed Bronze Finish</b></a> and \r\n<br>\r\nOther Lengths \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-matte-black-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull24-622\"><b>24\" Door Pull</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/48-inch-matte-black-square-ladder-pull-dwd-sqpull48-622\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD SQULL36-622 Contemporary Matte Black Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black 36 Inch Square Ladder Pull, DWD-SQPULL36-622",
                "description": "DWD-SQPULL36-622, Matte Black 36 Inch Square Ladder Pull - The Matte Black 36 Inch Square Ladder Pull has a rich finish that is a true black. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. It has a 24-1/2 inch center to center and the pull itself is 1-3/16 inches square, for a comfortable grip and a sturdy feel even on the heaviest of doors.\r\n",
